There is another way, of course.  You can just get your god angry at
you, and then sacrifice on another alignment's altar.  I do this all the
time with cavemen since I think a lawful caveman is a stupid concept. 
Give me chaos or give me death (usually, death).  #praying while
standing on an altar of a different alignment and then sacrificing on
said altar will do the trick.  Careful though...your god will frequently
do something nasty to you like cause a decrease in a stat or curse
objects you're carrying.  Small price to pay and all that.

If you're playing a character that starts out with the intrinsic 'you
have strayed', and you sacrifice straight away on a different altar, you
also convert.  This works for cavemen, I know.

